text:
When Fable 5 was available in Claude Code, I created a project called "ClaudeArt" which generates these really satisfying videos from text snippets in an art form inspired by Claude FM.

Fable 5 in Claude Code created the pipeline in one shot with me just conveying intent that emerged after many failed attempts at building a video-based AI-driven storytelling system.

@Claude created a very emotional story called "the context window" and made me empathize with Claude when it "compacts" and @Claude used @ElevenLabs for the audio and it literally does a lot of heavy-lifting which is kinda invisible but "load-bearing" 😅😅

@belltyler @bcherny @trq212 @amorriscode check it out:

